WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:05.270
Ever wondered what the innermost desire of
SCP-140, or "An Incomplete Chronicle" might

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.270
be?

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:11.639
Foundation researchers took a photo of SCP-140
while it was at rest inside of its vault,

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:12.920
and this was the result:

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:19.050
"A number of ornately-dressed women look on
with approval at an assortment of human corpses

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.840
impaled on stakes.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.440
Said corpses include civilians of multiple
ethnicities, soldiers dressed in the military

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:31.340
uniforms of a number of countries and Foundation,
Global Occult Coalition and Horizon Initiative

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.450
operatives.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.770
Background buildings are gray and appear to
be made of basalt."

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:40.910
This is certainly one wish we can all hope
never comes true.

